{"metaDescription":"","name":"Courier","metaTitle":"Courier","mobile":"","content":"<div class=\"courier-page\">\r\n        <div class=\"page-heading wide\">\r\n            <div class=\"container\">\r\n                <div class=\"breadcrumbs\">\r\n                    <a href=\"\">Home</a>\r\n                    <span class=\"sep\">></span>\r\n                    <a href=\"\">Services</a>\r\n                    <span class=\"sep\">></span>\r\n                    <span class=\"current\">Collecting parcels</span>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <h1>Collecting parcels</h1>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"redline\"></div>\r\n\r\n                <p>We do courier service in USA (collecting parcels) and Georgia (Parcel Delivery) Aenean massa. Cum sociis natoque penatibus et magnis dis parturient montes, nascetur ridiculus mus. Donec quam felis, ultricies nec, pellentesque eu, pretium quis, sem. Nulla consequat massa quis enim.</p>\r\n\r\n                <h3>We collect parcels in convenient for you way</h3>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n            <section class=\"courier-pickup\">            \r\n                <div class=\"calign\">\r\n                    <h2>Pick UP Services</h2>\r\n                    <div class=\"redline\"></div>\r\n                    <p class=\"section-info\">We do optimization of Pick UP Services by area to lower service cost and parcel handling time. Courier provides free boxes and tape for customer. We do pick up from following states and borrows</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"pickup-locations\">\r\n                    <div class=\"item\">\r\n                        <i class=\"icon icon-map\"></i>\r\n                        <div class=\"item-r\">\r\n                            <div class=\"title\">Brooklyn</div>\r\n                            <div class=\"desc\">\r\n                                Pick Up minimum 10 KG <br>Service cost 10 $ <br>Available all days except of Sun\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"item\">\r\n                        <i class=\"icon icon-map\"></i>\r\n                        <div class=\"item-r\">\r\n                            <div class=\"title\">New Jersey</div>\r\n                            <div class=\"desc\">\r\n                                Pick Up minimum 15 KG <br>Pick up cost 10$ <br>Available Mon, Wed and Fri\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"item\">\r\n                        <i class=\"icon icon-map\"></i>\r\n                        <div class=\"item-r\">\r\n                            <div class=\"title\">Queens</div>\r\n                            <div class=\"desc\">\r\n                                Pick Up minimum 15 KG <br>Service cost 10 $ <br>Available Tuesday or Thursday\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"item\">\r\n                        <i class=\"icon icon-map\"></i>\r\n                        <div class=\"item-r\">\r\n                            <div class=\"title\">Connecticut</div>\r\n                            <div class=\"desc\">\r\n                                Pick Up minimum from 25 KG <br>Service cost 30$ <br>Available Tuesday or Thursday\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"item\">\r\n                        <i class=\"icon icon-map\"></i>\r\n                        <div class=\"item-r\">\r\n                            <div class=\"title\">Bronx</div>\r\n                            <div class=\"desc\">\r\n                                Pick Up minimum 20 KG <br>Service cost 20$ <br>Available Tuesday or Thursday\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"item\">\r\n                        <i class=\"icon icon-map\"></i>\r\n                        <div class=\"item-r\">\r\n                            <div class=\"title\">South Jersey</div>\r\n                            <div class=\"desc\">\r\n                                Pick Up minimum 15 KG <br>and 20$ pick up cost, <br>Available Mon, Wed and Fri\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"item\">\r\n                        <i class=\"icon icon-map\"></i>\r\n                        <div class=\"item-r\">\r\n                            <div class=\"title\">Long island</div>\r\n                            <div class=\"desc\">\r\n                                Pick Up minimum from 25 KG <br>Service cost from 25$ <br>Available Tuesday or Thursday\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"item\">\r\n                        <i class=\"icon icon-map\"></i>\r\n                        <div class=\"item-r\">\r\n                            <div class=\"title\">Philadelphia area</div>\r\n                            <div class=\"desc\">\r\n                                Pick Up minimum 15 KG <br>Service cost 10$ <br>Available Tuesday or Thursday\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </section>\r\n\r\n            <section class=\"courier-office\">            \r\n                <div class=\"calign\">\r\n                    <h2>Customer drops parcels to our office or in warehouse.</h2>\r\n                    <div class=\"redline\"></div>\r\n                    <p class=\"section-info\">In case of dropping of in office customer saves pick up or ship to us cost as well as customer has shortest cut off time to catch nearest flight. We provide free boxes and tape. </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"courier-offices\">\r\n                    <div class=\"item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"title\">Brooklyn, New York – Headquarter</div>\r\n                        <div class=\"desc\">Closest access to JFK Airport <br>Open: Mon-Fry 9AM – 7PM, Sat-Sun 10AM – 5PM</div>\r\n                        <div class=\"map\">\r\n                            <img src=\"/img/tmp/map.jpg\" alt=\"\">\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"item\">\r\n                        <div class=\"title\">Wilmington, Delaware</div>\r\n                        <div class=\"desc\">Tax free shopping state <br>Open: Mon-Friday 9AM – 7PM, Sat-Sun Closed. </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"map\">\r\n                            <img src=\"/img/tmp/map2.jpg\" alt=\"\">\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </section>\r\n\r\n            <section class=\"courier-options\">\r\n                <div class=\"calign\">\r\n                    <h2>Customer ships to us</h2>\r\n                    <div class=\"redline\"></div>\r\n                    <p class=\"section-info\">In case if customer don’t have possibility to use any of two options above they can:</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n                \r\n                <div class=\"courier-options-cols\">\r\n                    <div class=\"courier-options-col\">\r\n                        <div class=\"title\">Ship to our locations</div>\r\n                        <div class=\"item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"item-l\">A</span>\r\n                            <div class=\"item-r\">\r\n                                <p>If it’s personal parcel (customer drops it to any parcel service company) it mast be sent to <a href=\"\">New York</a></p>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"item-l\">B</span>\r\n                            <div class=\"item-r\">\r\n                                <p>If its online order from any store can be shipped to any location but preferred Delaware because of tax free shopping area.  </p>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"or-col\"><span>or</span></div>\r\n                    <div class=\"courier-options-col\">\r\n                        <div class=\"title\">UPS service</div>\r\n                        <div class=\"item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"item-l\">A</span>\r\n                            <div class=\"item-r\">\r\n                                <p>We can arrange UPS drivers visit to your place but unfortunately we don’t have accurate visit time of UPS driver. On this case customer has to be in home for several hours.</p>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"item\">\r\n                            <span class=\"item-l\">B</span>\r\n                            <div class=\"item-r\">\r\n                                <p>We can create UPS shipping label if customer has opportunity to bring parcel in any nearest UPS store. In this case customer saves UPS pick up cost and wait time.</p>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            \r\n\r\n                <div class=\"courier-calc\">\r\n                    <div class=\"courier-calc-txt\">\r\n                        <p class=\"section-info\">Please fill up Request form to get Gzavnili's or UPS courier on your place.</p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    {COURIERCALC_FORM}\r\n                </div>\r\n            </section>\r\n\r\n            <section class=\"courier-georgia\">\r\n                <div class=\"calign\">\r\n                    <h2>Courier service in Georgia</h2>\r\n                    <div class=\"redline\"></div>                 \r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"txt\">\r\n                    <p>If customer live in capital of Georgia – Tbilisi or city Rustavi, we will deliver your package to your door on same or max nest days’ time from the time of arrival of your shipment to our premises. </p>\r\n\r\n                    <p>For those living outside Tbilisi, Georgia, your package will arrive at your doorstep within 2 to 3 business days. Delivery cost may apply and is 2-5$ per any up to 10 KG parcel. To save delivery cost or time our may also pick it from our Tbilisi office. Please see delivery time range by areas:</p>\r\n\r\n                    <p>Customers for online shipment delivery please ask for <a href=\"\">Delivery Request</a></p>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"georgia-map\">\r\n                    <div class=\"map-markers\">\r\n                        <div class=\"markers-group\">\r\n                            <div class=\"item\">\r\n                                <i class=\"icon icon-marker-1\"></i>\r\n                                <div class=\"desc\">One-day delivery to Tbilisi or Rustavi, Gori, Khashuri</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"item\">\r\n                                <i class=\"icon icon-marker-2\"></i>\r\n                                <div class=\"desc\">Two business days’ delivery: Kutaisi, Telavi, Poti, Batumi, Gori, Zugdidi, Akhaltsikhe, Ozurgeti</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"markers-group\">\r\n                            <div class=\"item\">\r\n                                <i class=\"icon icon-marker-3\"></i>\r\n                                <div class=\"desc\">Three business days’ delivery: <br>to other smaller cities and towns.</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"item\">\r\n                                <i class=\"icon icon-marker-4\"></i>\r\n                                <div class=\"desc\">Four business days’ delivery: <br>to other Georgia</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"map\">\r\n                        <img src=\"/img/map.jpg\" alt=\"\">\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </section>\r\n        </div>\r\n        \r\n    </div>","header":"","id":71,"groups":[],"url":"/courier.html","metaKeywords":"","type":1}